<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13592] .NET: Incorrect GetTotalPhysicalMemory result in Docker</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13592</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;MemoryInfo.GetTotalPhysicalMemory&lt;/tt&gt; uses &lt;tt&gt;/proc/meminfo&lt;/tt&gt; on Linux, which does not take Docker memory limit into account.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This affects:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;DataRegionConfiguration.DefaultMaxSize&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;MemoryPolicyConfiguration.DefaultMaxSize&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;The following tests fail in Docker when memory limit is set:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;IgniteConfigurationTest.TestSpringXml&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;IgnitionStartTest.TestIgniteStartsFromSpringXml&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
                <environment></environment>
